## 2a40f5258e  (2026-07-08)

Initial standardized snapshot at this commit. MobileGym eval reports the
official Success Rate: an episode scores 1.0 only when the final state satisfies
the goal and the agent ends through the success finish path.

Snapshots produced before the Success Rate switch used `progress_rate`
sub-goal shaping and are NOT comparable to this eval definition.
